  (text "FROM THE HAND-WRITTEN NETLIST THIS SHEET REPLACES (verbatim; the part notes are on each part's Note field):\n\nAUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. The ASCII drawing in breath-output-stage.md is a REPRESENTATION of this file,\nnot the other way round.\n\nHand-authored YAML is the first step and KiCad is generated from it later, so this is the file to edit. If\nthis and the drawing disagree, THIS WINS and the drawing is the defect - see hardware/README.md.\n\ntools/check-netlist.py proves: every refdes here exists in bom.csv with a matching value; every net has at\nleast two endpoints; every declared pin is used exactly once; and every `[REFDES value]` label in the page's\ndrawing agrees with this file.\n\nNets that cross this circuit's boundary. These must match the page's ## Interfaces table - that table is how a\nreader matches the two.\n\n[pins] CW = signal end, CCW = floor end\n\n[U-BREATH-OPA] ONE OPA2197 PACKAGE, BOTH HALVES: A buffers the gain pot's wiper, B is the summer. Its supply\npins are netted, with one C-DECOUPLE at each.\n\n[pins] dual series diode: anode, cathode, common\n\nTHE CLAMP'S RAILS ARE THE MODULE'S SUPPLY: \"D-JACK-CLAMP returns to both rails\" (the page's Interfaces table),\nnetted as pitch-stage and mod-channels net theirs." (at 40.64 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 69cfbe53-25cb-5da2-a984-9939765aba4d))
